@startuml
title VoNR Call Flow (5G SA + IMS) — SIP Signaling + RTP Media

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam participantPadding 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 90

actor "UE-A\n(Caller)" as UEA
actor "UE-B\n(Callee)" as UEB
participant "P-CSCF" as PCSCF
participant "S-CSCF" as SCSCF
participant "IMS App Server\n(TAS/AS)" as IMSSRV

== Precondition ==
note over UEA,UEB
UEs already registered on 5G SA and have
a PDU Session for IMS connectivity.
Voice uses 5G QoS flow (5QI).
end note

== IMS Registration ==
UEA -> PCSCF: SIP REGISTER
PCSCF -> SCSCF: SIP REGISTER
SCSCF -> IMSSRV: Service triggers / profile
IMSSRV --> SCSCF: OK
SCSCF --> PCSCF: 200 OK
PCSCF --> UEA: 200 OK

UEB -> PCSCF: SIP REGISTER
PCSCF -> SCSCF: SIP REGISTER
SCSCF -> IMSSRV: Service triggers / profile
IMSSRV --> SCSCF: OK
SCSCF --> PCSCF: 200 OK
PCSCF --> UEB: 200 OK

== Call Setup ==
UEA -> PCSCF: SIP INVITE (SDP offer)
PCSCF -> SCSCF: INVITE
SCSCF -> IMSSRV: Apply services
IMSSRV --> SCSCF: Proceed
SCSCF --> PCSCF: Route INVITE
PCSCF --> UEB: INVITE

UEB --> PCSCF: 180 Ringing
PCSCF --> UEA: 180 Ringing

UEB --> PCSCF: 200 OK (SDP answer)
PCSCF --> UEA: 200 OK

UEA -> PCSCF: ACK
PCSCF -> UEB: ACK

== Media ==
UEA <-> UEB: RTP/RTCP Media\n(voice packets)

== Release ==
UEA -> PCSCF: BYE
PCSCF -> UEB: BYE
UEB --> PCSCF: 200 OK
PCSCF --> UEA: 200 OK

note bottom
If VoNR not supported, UE may do EPS fallback to LTE (VoLTE).
end note
@enduml
